        "scope": "passage",
        "role": "passage_overview",
        "title": "Psa 83:1-18 . Of Asaph--(See on Psa 74:1 , title). The historical occasion is probably that of 2Ch 20:1 , 2 (compare Psa 47:1-9; 48:1-14). After a general petition, the craft and rage of the combined enemies are described, God's former dealings recited, and a like summary and speedy destruction on them is invoked."
      }
